    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've broken through the first defensive line!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are the casters doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though there's only one enemy in the vanguard...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are they just watching her tear us apart?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry, hurry! Take her out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "stop": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka! You're getting out of range!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't... give you cover from here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I look that reckless to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your four o'clock!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Liskarm, it's time for your debut!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be a sweetie and block the enemy's ranged attacks, won't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! Faster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Focus down the one with the sword first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_blunt_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Did we get her--?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't even think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You call those attacks, or are you just throwing sticks and stones?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-where'd this one come from?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I owe you one, Cap'n!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, Franka, your task was to launch a feint attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Instead, you fought your way all the way here. You have a huge target over your head now. Is that fine with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure is, after all, I have a trusty partner after all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... Gahh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka! You charged way too far ahead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "See? She caught up to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not used to this kind of stuff...! Why are you making me charge headlong into the enemy? I don't get it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Curses...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D. and Rhodes Island are working together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way we can defend this place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't afford to hesitate. It's do or die. Everyone, chaaarge!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 18,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemies are rushing straight at us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Dieeeee!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you plan to resist, you leave me with no choice. Don't take it personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "You...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_blunt_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 18,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$flashback"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaaaaghhh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam, you're... quite strong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Reunion fellow... Not his lucky day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've got some nerve to attack us like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel bad for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should apologize to those who died unjustly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Inspector!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad to see that you're all fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've collapsed their flank! The next step is to launch our all-out assault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine by me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything seems to be going smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "That probably won't last for much longer. The enemies have set up many obstacles, and are doing a good job of staying hidden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, be prepared for a hard fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, make sure you scout things out thoroughly and protect your squads!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, let's go rescue Misha together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
